tms36xx: TMS36XX family organ / melody generator (MM6221AA, TMS3615, TMS3617).

Upstream attribution
--------------------
  rtl/tms36xx.sv
    derived from : MAME src/devices/sound/tms36xx.cpp
    authors      : Juergen Buchmueller (MAME copyright-holder)
    license      : BSD-3-Clause
    also         : derived from the Sega G80 core's rtl/sound/tms36xx.sv (TMS3615 / TMS3617 only), extended with the
                   MM6221AA tune sequencer and fixed tunes 1-3.

  (MAME's file header names the copyright holder but gives no year.)

PENDING: confirm lineage. The G80 tms36xx.sv has an identical MAME header, so its own origin is unrecorded. If it came
from anyone other than Rodimus, name them and its license here.

